      "text": "**\ud83d\udd25 Re-enable the `--maxw-sm` responsive max-width rule (`src/static/style.css`, ~line 2528): it is currently commented out with the note *\"Dissabled temporarily for the Bialik presentation\"* (2026-06-25). This kills the `--maxw-sm` utility framework-wide for every consumer (Sage.is, Sage.Education, etc.). Restore the block inside the `-sm` media query:**\n- [x] Back in 1.4.0, live 2026-10-16 (core src/utilities/_sizing.css); the pinned /v1.3.2/ keeps it off as served\n\n`TODO.md:L7`",
