      ],
      "text": "**\ud83d\udcda API documented at `/docs/swap/` (`src/docs/swap.njk`): three attributes, four events, the nesting rule, the findings, size, licence.**\n`#ContentExcellence` `#docs`\n`TODO.md:L67`",
