      "line_num": 69,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#ContentExcellence"
      ],
      "text": "**\ud83c\udfaa Demo shipped at `/demo/swap/a.html`, `b.html`, `none.html` (`src/demo/swap/`), ported from AI-UI `cypress/fixtures/swap/`. `none.html` keeps a `<main>` on purpose.**\n`#ContentExcellence`\n`TODO.md:L69`",
