      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#docs",
        "#footgun"
      ],
      "text": "**\ud83e\udea4 Findings carried into the docs \u2014 no `<main>` default; click captures, submit bubbles; a redirected POST pushes history; plus the two found dogfooding (v1.1 card).**\n`#docs` `#footgun`\n`TODO.md:L71`",
