      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#dogfood"
      ],
      "text": "**\ud83c\udf31 Employed here (2026-09-05): `<script defer src=\"/swap.js\">` in `head.njk`, `data-swap` on `<main>` in `layout.njk`, `swap-host.njk` re-runs inline scripts.**\n`#dogfood`\n`TODO.md:L73`",
